[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Therefore, the function \( y = \frac{2}{x^2 + x - 6} \) has vertical asymptotes at \( x = -3 \) and \( x = 2 \).
