[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ V_{\text{cube}} = s^3 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Substituting \( s = 1 \) into the formula, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ V_{\text{cube}} = 1^3 = 1 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Therefore, the volume of the cube is \(\boxed{1}\) cubic inch.
