[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[p(x) = x^2 - (2a + b)x + 2ab\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m By comparing coefficients with the original polynomial \(x^2 + ax + b\), we can see that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[a = -(2a + b)\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[b = 2ab\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m From the first equation, we can solve for \(b\) in terms of \(a\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[a = -2a - b \implies 3a = -b \implies b = -3a\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
