[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Finally, we need to find \(a + b\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[a + b = \frac{1}{2} + \left(-\frac{3}{2}\right) = \frac{1}{2} - \frac{3}{2} = -1.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Thus, the value of \(a + b\) is \(\boxed{-1}\).
