[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ V_{\text{sphere}} = \frac{4}{3} \pi \left( \frac{s}{2} \right)^3 = \frac{4}{3} \pi \frac{s^3}{8} = \frac{\pi s^3}{6} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
