[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ \left\lfloor \frac{500}{60} \right\rfloor = \left\lfloor 8.3333 \right\rfloor = 8 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Therefore, the number of positive integers that are divisible by 3, 4, and 5 is \(\boxed{8}\).
