[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    The number of ways to choose 3 marbles from 11 is given by the combination formula \( \binom{11}{3} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \binom{11}{3} = \frac{11!}{3!(11-3)!} = \frac{11!}{3!8!} = \frac{11 \times 10 \times 9}{3 \times 2 \times 1} = 165
