[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \frac{4 + 5 + 6}{3} = \frac{15}{3} = 5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Now, we need to find the product of the three integers divided by their mean:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
