[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m So, the three consecutive integers are \( 10 \), \( 11 \), and \( 12 \). The mean of these integers is:
