[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Next, we need to find the area of the four triangles formed by the diagonals. Each triangle has a base of 2 and a height that is the apothem of the octagon. The apothem \( a \) of a regular octagon with side length \( s \) is:
