[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w} = \|\mathbf{v}\| \|\mathbf{w}\| \cos \theta
