[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m (n-1)n(n+1) = 120
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m We need to find the value of \( n \) such that the product is 120. Let's test some values of \( n \):
