[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m a_k = 5 + (k-1)(-2) = 5 - 2(k-1) = 7 - 2k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m So, the \( k \)-th term of \( B \) is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
