[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 1. **Calculate the total number of ways to choose 3 marbles from 11 marbles without any restrictions.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    This is given by the combination formula \( \binom{n}{k} = \frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!} \), where \( n \) is the total number of items, \( k \) is the number of items to choose, and \( ! \) denotes factorial.
