[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 1. \(x^2 - 24x + y^2 - 32y + 384 = 0\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 2. \(x^2 + 24x + y^2 + 32y + 384 = 0\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m We complete the square for both equations.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m For the first equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[x^2 - 24x + y^2 - 32y + 384 = 0\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[(x-12)^2 - 144 + (y-16)^2 - 256 + 384 = 0\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[(x-12)^2 + (y-16)^2 = 16\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m For the second equation:
