[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \text{Area of one triangle} = \frac{1}{2} \times 49 = 24.5 \text{ square inches}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 4. **Calculate the perimeter of one of the congruent triangles:**
