[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 1. **Determine the side length of the original square:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    The area of the original square is given as 49 square inches. Therefore, the side length of the square is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \sqrt{49} = 7 \text{ inches}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    \]
