[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ T(b+1) - T(b) = \frac{(b+1)(b+2)}{2} - \frac{n(n+1)}{2} = \frac{(b+1)(b+2) - n(n+1)}{2} = \frac{b^2 + 3b + 2 - n^2 - n}{2} = \frac{(b-n)(b+n+3)}{2} = T(x). \]
