[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m    The argument of the logarithm, \(\sqrt{\sin x}\), must be positive. Since \(\sin x\) ranges from 0 to 1 in the given interval, \(\sqrt{\sin x}\) ranges from 0 to 1. Therefore, the domain of the function is \(0^\circ < x < 180^\circ\).
