[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m The probability of the fourth roll resulting in a win is \(\frac{1}{2}\). Therefore, the probability of the game being won before the fourth turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \frac{1}{27} \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{1}{54}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Thus, the probability that the game will be won before the fourth turn is \(\boxed{\frac{1}{54}}\).
