[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m So, the x-coordinate of the vertex is \( m = 1 \). To find the y-coordinate of the vertex, we substitute \( x = 1 \) back into the original equation:
