[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m - \( r \) is the annual interest rate (decimal).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m - \( n \) is the number of times that interest is compounded per year.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m - \( t \) is the time the money is invested for in years.
