[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m [response] To determine how many pots have three different colored balloons attached, we need to find the number of pots that are marked with both a red balloon and a blue balloon, and also a yellow balloon. This is equivalent to finding the least common multiple (LCM) of the numbers 4, 6, and 10.
