[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ x^2 + x - 6 = (x + 3)(x - 2). \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m Setting the denominator equal to zero gives us the solutions:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ x + 3 = 0 \quad \text{or} \quad x - 2 = 0, \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m \[ x = -3 \quad \text{or} \quad x = 2. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m So, the function has vertical asymptotes at \( x = -3 \) and \( x = 2 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=6911)[0m 
